{"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema\/Enumeration","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent"],"anchor":"Events"},{"title":"Property values","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refinement","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Constraint","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ValidationKeyword","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/UnsatisfiedConstraint","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/InvalidConstraint","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConstraintViolation"],"anchor":"Property-values"},{"title":"Records","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SourceLocation","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"],"anchor":"Records"},{"title":"Stores","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"],"anchor":"Stores"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"Events","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"Events"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The types every other module shares: the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An event is a value that conforms to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event"},{"type":"text","text":", declared with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":". Its stored properties"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are its properties, so a misspelled or mistyped one is a compile error. Its type gives the name"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destinations record it under, the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory"},{"type":"text","text":" whose consent decides whether it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivered, and the version of its shape. Each has a default: the type’s name,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory\/analytics"},{"type":"text","text":" and 1."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two property types carry rules of their own. A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" value, such as an email address,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<redacted>"},{"type":"text","text":" and has no public accessor: a destination reads it through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/reveal(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which gives "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" once a delivery has redacted the record. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refined","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" value satisfies every "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Constraint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Refinement","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists, checked once as it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"made: its initializer throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/UnsatisfiedConstraint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a value that breaks one. Each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Constraint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" spelling throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/InvalidConstraint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for an argument no schema can hold, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a negative length."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Trackers"},{"type":"text","text":") makes an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord"},{"type":"text","text":" of each event it tracks: the event, its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"random identifier, when and where it was tracked, and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" it was tracked in."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Destinations receive batches of these records. An "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"type":"text","text":" adds to a record’s context: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker runs it on every record, or a destination’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enriched(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":" on the records it receives."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare an event with "},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"code":"EventMacros","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", part of "},{"code":"import Traffluent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). It derives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance from the struct’s declaration and fills in its "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"@Constrained","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" beside a property fills in "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event\/constraintViolation()","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". To write the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conformance by hand instead, see "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Traffluent","","enum PlanName: Refinement {","    static var constraints: [Constraint<String>] {","        get throws(InvalidConstraint) { try [.minLength(1), .maxLength(32)] }","    }","}","","@Event(consent: .functional)","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: Refined<String, PlanName>","    var email: Sensitive<String>","}","","let event = SignedUp(plan: try Refined(\"pro\"), email: Sensitive(\"ada@example.com\"))","let record = EventRecord(event: event, timestamp: .now, sourceLocation: nil)","let name = record.name  \/\/ \"SignedUp\"","let email = record.reveal(event.email)  \/\/ nil: a record made by hand keeps its sensitive values redacted","let empty = try? Refined<String, PlanName>(\"\")  \/\/ nil: it throws UnsatisfiedConstraint.minLength"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/definingevents"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events"]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Acknowledger":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Acknowledger"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Acknowledger"}],"title":"Acknowledger","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What keeps records until their delivery is acknowledged: a store, as a delivery sees it."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/revealsSensitiveValues":{"title":"revealsSensitiveValues","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"revealsSensitiveValues"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/reveal(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" gives the event’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values: "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the records a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker makes, "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" once a delivery redacts them ("},{"code":"redactingSensitiveValues()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") and for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records made with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/init(